{"title": "Till Death Do Us Part", "pageid": 12867, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Till_Death_Do_Us_Part", "categories": ["Rings", "Rare items", "Healing set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png/300px-Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/d/d8/Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Till Death Do Us Part image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png/300px-Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Partner_Ring_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Til_Death_Do_Us_Part\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Til Death Do Us Part\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Til Death Do Us Part</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that grants its wearer the ability to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beacon_of_Hope\" title=\"Beacon of Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp/25px-Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp/38px-Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp/50px-Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beacon of Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp/25px-Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Beacon_of_Hope_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beacon_of_Hope\" title=\"Beacon of Hope\">Beacon of Hope</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Love is the sweetest bird that might migrate to the charming country of your heart.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring